  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f11b80ad95b069e50a3f8e57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "事务所收到了一堆庆生的信和礼物。\n大家都好好地记着我的生日的呢…\n当然，你也是啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57e13f202b3707b2e3e1d79625b3ace92fb17450ab009b3d4d0e4d0d2e0da32d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb0e8de46e888c84f3372c96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做点什么吗？\n什么为什么…今天是我的生日啊！\n快点祝我生日快乐。隆重点哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06d69bb2d3ca6220ac091dd68c457e7e44c00a8224b6b30320251661de2d950d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6dd90cb93b9c848903561cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看新公告了吗？\n上面有时候会写一些重要信息，\n读一下也没什么损失嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99b4bb2f77c8722a79987633801ee457874633013f379c6687e4bc3981258edd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55391d09e3f11ccad595caf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了哦。\n让我也一起瞧瞧看吧？\n…有什么不好的嘛，小气鬼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a4c33c47a1aea7520249b3e59e2128ae935272eb0113656acf5fb63bfdd9e80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f67d3b8d5b653386ca94cea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦！任务完成了？\n挺能干的嘛。你就在这种地方显得特别能干呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7259b6e654de30438a12407af7e3f46addaaf5a31cff11eed629ca5c2324ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e18973e7125b27e5f60900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你去看了吗？\n看什么…新活动啊。\n还没看的话，现在去看一眼？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7457fc239fd64531cf5a3902bc8e64b4d19ccb9375fde32c1a1a4f9d04e0af4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:443b64f72eded7b052665af1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像大家在做什么有趣的事情呢。\n我对活动也挺感兴趣的，\n要去看一眼吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "53d190bd8e9957b5abd46c3a4cd4be69981fb89f0640b69059dee89c8bb4c2b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1645194da3caf66585e674be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "输掉了啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e1b91ec7b749917535a3b467abfdf0bc4bc754a26b94fb4475c4662270e4906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2749041e7086ccc82c6494d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴等级提升了呢。\n要去看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88ddefb04e050495c7d8a0827ebb7c042e96f8bf3a04814d3e4fb5d938e9d51d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c298c57d31899ec103d319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢单色系。不过会想用\r\n偏鲜艳的强调色取得平衡……\r\n是因为辣妹精神的关系？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e4b77847d1ce6f84fa5ebc125acdb768d6d291fd628d9ddaff36c5532c1527c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17fc87ec6401e85c8d2aa2df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挑选让自己看起来有格调的衣服\r\n很重要。如今没有烦人的搭讪和签约\r\n来找我了……你知道是为什么吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3a7fc3703911f969fe4c5649187a05bf83132bec7f3e876a32671c5e78f4ee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b97ff30e21beb1c69eeb30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和造型师去购物时买的东西\r\n应该最多了。听到专家的称赞……\r\n嗯，就会觉得心情愉快嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cc3d5d48a4c465e73cfefcba1b7a7975b835adf73c3989e3e45563185b49c67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6653befc3d408486f37840b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不赖嘛…",
      "source_fingerprint": "556dcadf2db1d657f491ab1e9c6b7df7ca2b772b07d7683e5bd503845ad7df31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a8b5da9515c03c045a5c870",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是赢了更开心啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd1310d06aeaaaf0c9f511d89e58c6df2b2e543f38d05fc8cc2de8aefa160b44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:086eb6ce6ac4c1a93a4ffa3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "输掉了啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e1b91ec7b749917535a3b467abfdf0bc4bc754a26b94fb4475c4662270e4906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
